ile-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\">Tolna Tome-Monger</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The future is unknown; the present is mysterious; the past is gone forever. But for those devotees of the School of <a href=\"/wiki/Divination\" title=\"Divination\">Divination</a>, the veil of unknowability surrounding our world entire is thinnest.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nKey terms: Seek, know, discover, perceive\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nKey concepts: Seeing, Comprehending, Guiding, Detecting\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210348\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1525/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25723/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6378/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931456/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.671      1 -total\n 98.02%   41.827      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 51.77%   22.089      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.57%   19.447     15 Template:Trim\n 23.98%   10.231      2 Template:Uid\n 15.45%    6.592      2 Template:Icon_link\n 15.35%    6.549      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.25%    5.653      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.07%    5.151      1 Template:Books\n 10.71%    4.572      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:45427-0!canonical and timestamp 2026